WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.851
Watch and read: Ama asks: Fill the missing preposition: “We meet blank Monday.”

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.223
The answer is: on. Use on for days, in for months and at for clock times.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:15.437
Watch and read: For your sentencebuild practice, choose the correct sentence about

00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:16.537
Ama and rice.

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:22.467
The answer is: Ama likes rice.. A sentence puts the subject and action in a clear

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:22.785
order.
